{"id":"fc596ec4c1021296","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-derandomization-prg.md","title":"去随机化伪随机生成器","display":"df-derandomization-prg — 去随机化伪随机生成器","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-derandomization-prg","aliases":["28-df-derandomization-prg"],"display":"df-derandomization-prg — 去随机化伪随机生成器","depends_on":["[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.2 and §20.1.1","source_printed_pages":"403–405","source_pdf_pages":"429–431","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-derandomization-prg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-derandomization-prg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derandomization-prg — 去随机化伪随机生成器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.2 and §20.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"403–405"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"429–431"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\ell\">\\(G_\\ell\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\ell\">\\(\\Sigma^\\ell\\)</span> 的限制。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、机器输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(z)\">\\(M(z)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(z)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(z)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fool}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{Fool}_m\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\\left[\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell\\;|G(z)|=S(\\ell)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(M(z)=G(z)\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(z)\\le2^{c(|z|+1)}\\bigr)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\\exists\\ell_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\ell\\ge\\ell_0\\;\\operatorname{Fool}_{S(\\ell)}(G_\\ell(U_\\ell);S(\\ell)^3,\\tfrac1{10})\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\\left[\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell\\;|G(z)|=S(\\ell)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(M(z)=G(z)\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(z)\\le2^{c(|z|+1)}\\bigr)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\\exists\\ell_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\ell\\ge\\ell_0\\;\\operatorname{Fool}_{S(\\ell)}(G_\\ell(U_\\ell);S(\\ell)^3,\\tfrac1{10})\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点明确采用 Definition 20.2 的渐近版本：允许有限多个种子长度例外，计算时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{O(\\ell)}\">\\(2^{O(\\ell)}\\)</span>，而原文把时间界写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\ell\">\\(2^\\ell\\)</span>、欺骗条件写为每个长度。前者适合保留本目录机器编码产生的常数；本次不声称任意渐近版本可在保持同一伸长函数时改成原书的精确 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\ell\">\\(2^\\ell\\)</span> 版本。后续本目录模拟结论只使用这里明写的版本。\n第9章密码学 PRG 见本目录的 prg 节点：那里要求生成器为多项式时间，并欺骗任意均匀多项式时间区分器。这里允许生成器比被欺骗的电路花费更多时间，且测试为非一致电路。定义不强制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(\\ell)&gt;\\ell\">\\(S(\\ell)&gt;\\ell\\)</span>；去随机化的有效伸长另由具体命题给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness","status":"resolved","id":"d42ba324c0358975","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor"